        3 \\
        2 \\
        5
        \end{bmatrix}$, and define a transformation $T:\text{ℝ}^{2}\rightarrow\text{ℝ}^{3}$ by $T(\mathbf{x}) = A\mathbf{x}$, so that

paragraph.math:
$$\begin{bmatrix}
        x_{1} \\
        x_{2} \\
        x_{3}
        \end{bmatrix}\,\mapsto\,\,\begin{bmatrix}
        1 & 0 & 0 \\
        0 & 1 & 0 \\
        0 & 0 & 0
