        \end{bmatrix}$, and define $T:\text{ℝ}^{2}\rightarrow\text{ℝ}^{2}$ by $T(\mathbf{x}) = A\mathbf{x}$. Find the images under $T$ of $\mathbf{u} = \,\mspace{-4mu}\,\,\mspace{-4mu}\left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
